// Engine functions that the sithAIInstinct instinct functions call and that the vector tests replace with the stubs of
// sithAIInstinctFnVec.h and Libs/sith/Tests/Vec/sithVecWorld.h (see Libs/sith/Tests/Vec/README.md).
//  SITHVEC_SEAM:   engine calls; the capture harness patches the original function to jump to the stub
//  SITHVEC_LOOKUP: pure lookups that read engine globals; the harness leaves the original running on the synthetic
//                  world and verifies the stub against it
// Each name N is replaced by sithVec_N in the tested source (sithAIInstinctFnVecTested.c, which compiles sithAIInstinct.c).
// The helpers of sithAIInstinct.c itself (BasicFallow called by WallCrawl, SnakeFindMovePos, SnakeMungeTestCheck,
// SnakePlaySlitherSound) run unchanged on both sides.
